!!! A variant named without its owner.
!!!
!!! Every neighbouring language spells construction 'Ready(1)'. Matrix always
!!! writes a variant through its owner, so the bare leaf arrives as an
!!! ordinary name and reports only "Undefined identifier", which sends the
!!! reader looking for a missing import or an unregistered function instead of
!!! at the spelling.
book diagnostic.bare-variant-leaf

Outcome begin choice
    when Ready holding number
    when Failed holding text
end choice

main returns number begin paragraph
    value done is Ready holding 1
    give 0
end paragraph
